#Name: Mouadh Ahmed — Security Learning Journey

Télécoms/Réseaux engineering student (SR — Sécurité Réseau specialization), building toward a **Blue Team / SOC Analyst** career. This profile and my [`security-notes`](https://github.com/Doom4Alpha/security-notes) repo track my learning log: notes, hands-on lab work, and progress through certifications, coursework, and platforms like TryHackMe.

I'm not documenting polished writeups here — this is a working log of what I'm learning, what clicked, and what I built to test it.

