## 🎯 Current Focus

**Blue Team / SOC path** — chosen after comparing job market availability (~80-90% of cybersecurity roles vs ~5-10% for red team), salary trajectory, and hands-on skill-transfer against red team. Blue-team-first is also the stronger route into red or purple team later, if that ever becomes the goal — this is a foundation, not a narrowing.

Specialization: **SR (Sécurité Réseau)** within a Télécoms/Réseaux license — network + telecom security.

