## 🧪 Home Lab

Building a hands-on lab to turn course material into something real rather than passive:
- VirtualBox on a Windows host, starting with an Ubuntu Server VM (terminal-only, closer to real server/SOC environments)
- Practicing core Linux fundamentals before expanding to a second VM
- Next: a two-VM setup on an internal network, capturing traffic with `tcpdump` and analyzing it in Wireshark
- Later: Security Onion for a real mini-SOC monitoring stack (Suricata, Zeek, Elastic)

See [`security-notes/lab`](https://github.com/Doom4Alpha/security-notes/tree/main/lab) for setup notes and exercises.

